 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? Try moving the mic away from walls, windows and large furniture. A chair or table is usually enough. Add some blankets or cushions on the walls, or put few books on top of them. The thick stuff matters more than the distance. Two or three feet is usually enough, but it' worth trying a bit closer and seeing how it sounds. Good idea. Listen on headphones too, so the echo doesn't surprise you during the recording.",
